    },
    {
      "subId": "7000003",
      "subQuestName": "给教堂前的神像留影",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "700000301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "700000301": {
            "id": "700000301",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "萨义德",
            "text": "名字就叫《风花节研究报告》的话…不行，不够响亮。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7000006",
      "subQuestName": "将画片交给萨义德",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "700000601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "700000601": {
            "id": "700000601",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "萨义德",
            "text": "你们已经拍好画片了吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700000602"
            ]
          },
          "700000602": {
            "id": "700000602",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "全都拍好了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700000603"
            ]
          },
          "700000603": {
            "id": "700000603",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "萨义德",
            "text": "嗯，你拍得很不错，我的研究肯定能用得上这些画片。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700000604"
            ]
          },
          "700000604": {
            "id": "700000604",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "萨义德",
            "text": "看到这么美的景色…我想起了家乡须弥的节日…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700000605"
            ]
          },
          "700000605": {
            "id": "700000605",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "须弥有什么节日？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700000606"
            ]
          },
          "700000606": {
            "id": "700000606",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "萨义德",
            "text": "噢，你应该不知道吧，我们每年都会举办「花神诞日」，用来纪念「小吉祥草王」的诞生。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700000607"
            ]
          },
          "700000607": {
            "id": "700000607",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "萨义德",
            "text": "但如果就气氛而言的话，还是和蒙德城的风花节略有差别的…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700000608"
            ]
          },
          "700000608": {
            "id": "700000608",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "萨义德",
            "text": "说起来…今年的花神诞日我也没能参加。唉，这么长时间了，也不知道教令院现在是什么情况…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700000609"
            ]
          },
          "700000609": {
            "id": "700000609",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "萨义德",
            "text": "话说远了，总之感谢你的帮忙，这些报酬请你收下吧。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7000005",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
